      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KADE'S THUNDER (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by a nose at this track in a handy 22.69. Fair draw can see a good run and has the ability and in winning form. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Hard to fault recent form and looks a key chance again. DREAM BIG (8) turned in a solid run last start over 400m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 3 lengths (22.89). Great chance to atone. AUNTY CHERYL (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Ballarat over 390m behind Gas Lantern (22.99) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Worth following up. MISSY WHO (6) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
